! Cisco relays default to PROPRIETARY option-82 suboptions (150/151/152) with
! "ip dhcp relay information option vpn". Third-party servers (Kea) only understand
! the RFC 3527/5107 standard ones (5/11) -- without this, inter-VRF relayed requests
! arrive with a global giaddr and an unreadable link-selection, and Kea NAKs them.
ip dhcp compatibility suboption link-selection standard
ip dhcp compatibility suboption server-override standard
